# Chat Session Report – Boon System Implementation

### Session Summary
- **Date:** January 2025
- **Version:** 0.9.20 → 0.9.21 (Patch Increment)
- **Focus:** Complete Boon Ledger system implementation with character dropdowns and dual schema support

### What We Accomplished

#### 1. Boon System - Complete Implementation
- **Database Table** – Created `boons` table schema with placeholders for future Agent integration
- **Admin Page** – Built `boon_ledger.php` with Bootstrap table, modals, and CRUD interface
- **API Endpoint** – Created RESTful API (`api_boons.php`) with GET, POST, PUT, DELETE operations
- **JavaScript Module** – Built `admin_boons.js` for modal management and AJAX operations
- **Admin Navigation** – Added "Boons" button to admin panel navigation row

#### 2. Character Dropdowns with Custom Option
- **Character Selection** – Replaced text inputs with dropdowns populated from `characters` table
- **Custom Option** – Added "-- Custom / Other --" option for characters not in database
- **Dynamic Fields** – Custom text input appears/hides based on dropdown selection
- **Data Handling** – Hidden fields sync selected character names or custom text values
- **Edit Support** – When editing, checks if saved name exists in dropdown or uses custom field

#### 3. Dual Schema Support
- **Schema Detection** – API automatically detects table structure (new vs old schema)
- **Old Schema Support** – Works with existing `boons` table using `creditor_id`/`debtor_id` foreign keys
- **New Schema Support** – Works with new schema using `giver_name`/`receiver_name` text fields
- **Status Mapping** – Converts between UI status values and database values automatically
- **Character Lookup** – When using old schema, looks up character IDs by name

#### 4. Enhanced Error Handling
- **Detailed Errors** – API now returns actual database error messages instead of generic failures
- **Console Logging** – JavaScript logs all API requests/responses for debugging
- **Table Detection** – Checks if table exists and provides helpful error messages
- **Validation** – Client-side and server-side validation for all fields

### Technical Implementation Details

#### Database
- **`database/create_boons_table.sql`**:
  - Creates `boons` table with `giver_name`/`receiver_name` text fields
  - Includes `giver_ref`/`receiver_ref` placeholders for future foreign keys
  - No foreign keys initially (as specified in requirements)
  - Indexes on status, giver_name, receiver_name for performance

#### PHP Changes
- **`admin/boon_ledger.php`**:
  - Queries `characters` table to populate dropdowns
  - Bootstrap table with responsive design matching admin panel style
  - Modal forms for create/edit with character dropdowns
  - Status filtering dropdown
  - Action buttons per row (Edit, Mark Paid, Mark Broken, Delete)

- **`admin/api_boons.php`**:
  - Detects table schema (old vs new) automatically
  - Handles both schemas with appropriate queries
  - Maps status values between UI and database
  - Looks up character IDs when using old schema
  - Enhanced error messages with actual database errors

- **`admin/admin_panel.php`**:
  - Added "Boons" navigation button matching existing style

#### JavaScript Changes
- **`js/admin_boons.js`**:
  - Dropdown change handlers for giver/receiver fields
  - Custom field show/hide logic
  - Hidden field synchronization (`updateGiverName()`, `updateReceiverName()`)
  - Edit mode: checks if saved name exists in dropdown or uses custom
  - Enhanced error logging to console
  - Form validation before submission

#### Character Data Updates
- **`reference/Characters/characters.json`**:
  - Updated Core (Alexandra Chen) entry with full background details
  - Updated Phreak entry with full background details
  - Extracted information from "Computer Nosferatu.md" background document

